      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/gist/has_multiplier",
      "description": "Relates a unit of measure to another unit of measure that is a factor, or relates an aspect to another aspect that is a factor.",
      "comments": [
        "Provides a supplemental method of decomposing a unit of measure or aspect into component factors. Enables dimensional analysis such as miles per hour x hours = miles."
