      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/gist/exponent_of_mole",
      "description": "The exponent of mole in a product of powers of base units.",
      "notes": [
        "OWL domain: (gist:UnitGroup | gist:UnitOfMeasure)"
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "value": "In the equation '1 katal = 1 x mole per second'\r\n\r\n\t\tthe conversion factor for katal is 1\r\n\t\tthe exponent of mole is 1\r\n\t\tthe exponent of second is -1\r\n\t\tall other exponents are zero\r\n\r\n\t\tEvery member of a unit group containing katal must be a multiple of mole per second.",
          "@type": "Example"
        }
      ],
      "in_subset": [
        "gist_core"
      ],
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/gist/core",
